<div class="divtype0" id="parac2d2c05" data-scene="1">Scene name here</div><div class="divtype1" id="parc59115b6">Song 1: You Can't Stop The Beat</div><div class="divtype2" id="par2f4a0881">Words</div><div class="divtype2" id="par19487432">Words</div><div class="divtype2" id="par6d135009">Words</div><div class="divtype2" id="parc37be061">Words</div><div class="divtype2" id="pard7d4ae60">Words</div><div class="divtype3" id="paraf8e338f">MUSICAL BOOTH PERSON - ERIN</div><div class="divtype5" id="par777e96ba">…Andddd that’s basically what the Mac Eng Musical’s about! Engineering students bringing forth their inner theatre kids and being obnoxiously loud all year! So I’ll say it again, the world is a stage and our lives are the stories. (Aggressively) What’s your story then chum?</div><div class="divtype3" id="parb14a5f9c">FIRST YEAR 1 - Cadyn</div><div class="divtype5" id="par7709d49e">Um…what?</div><div class="divtype3" id="parc19de54d">MUSICAL BOOTH PERSON</div><div class="divtype5" id="par246f23ef">Don’t worry about it! Just join!</div><div class="divtype3" id="pare70f4477">FIRST YEAR 2</div><div class="divtype5" id="parb1351fd7">Oh yeah… I uhhh definitely will do that, I just have to go check on my roommate really quickly, he’s always gooning in my half of the room.</div><div class="divtype2" id="parbe8e31ce">[FIRST YEAR 1 and 2 walks to another club booth]</div><div class="divtype3" id="par5b75c5a4">G-BOGG MEMBER 1</div><div class="divtype5" id="pard9ae5980">Dude, you guys gotta get in on this gravitational toboggan stuff, if you’re into gravity, sustainability and nasty dart rips, G-bogg is just the place for you.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par988b659a">MES MEMBER 1</div><div class="divtype2" id="parb327a1a9">[interrupting the G_BOGG members sales pitch]</div><div class="divtype5" id="par10379dd6">No, don’t join G-Bogg, join the MES, the place where you get to untie logistical knots that have been woven for centuries before us, and get no credit from the student body!</div><div class="divtype3" id="par0a33cdb7">FIRST YEAR 1 - CADYN</div><div class="divtype5" id="par08507bfe">Wait! I have heard about this MES, you can put that on your resume right??</div><div class="divtype3" id="pare770b67b">MES MEMBER 1</div><div class="divtype5" id="par1e607ec3">YES YOU CAN! We’re not hiring like right right now, but definitely follow us on instagram for all the updates!</div><div class="divtype2" id="para63f38a6">[MES MEMBER and FY’s go their separate ways]</div><div class="divtype3" id="par2f95d0f7">FIRST YEAR 2 - max</div><div class="divtype5" id="pare460a95d">Whew! You know, I’d heard great things about the clubbing scene here, and it’s true! All these clubs and teams seem so exciting! Formula Natural Gas can expect an application from me!</div><div class="divtype3" id="para3e560dd">NATE</div><div class="divtype2" id="par76efef0a">[Walking up to first year crowd]</div><div class="divtype5" id="par1ed57892">Hey, are you guys also in first year? There’s so many clubs here, I don’t even know where to start!</div><div class="divtype3" id="paref02c450">FIRST YEAR 3 - olivia</div><div class="divtype5" id="par21dc12e8">Yeah, I already looked into all of them this summer, and there are so many opportunities to be a well-rounded experiential learner through hands-on and engaging clubs!</div><div class="divtype3" id="par39809bc9">FIRST YEAR 4 - carmen</div><div class="divtype5" id="par85a475d4">I’m so worried I’m late in looking for summer co-ops. It’s already Welcome Week and I only started applying on LinkedIn two months ago. At this rate, all the good ones will be gone! I’ll be stuck raising the roaches that get released into Centro.</div><div class="divtype3" id="parf3ed5b90">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par169637af">Oh wow okay… you’re already looking at co-ops? Maybe I should make a LinkedIn then…</div><div class="divtype3" id="par0b81f4c6">FIRST YEAR 5 - Evan</div><div class="divtype5" id="par92989230">Well I’m actually Linked-Out since I’m totally chilling. My aunt’s already got a job lined up for me at Nepo Baby Inc.</div><div class="divtype3" id="parea9f47d4">FIRST YEAR 6 - synthia</div><div class="divtype5" id="par4b806a14">I’m also chilling! My optometrist promised me a consulting co-op with the Eckleberg Group!</div><div class="divtype3" id="parad7c7a63">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par5bab3378">I don’t really have any connections yet… I guess my cousin ROSIE does go here though! Maybe that counts…</div><div class="divtype2" id="par7c1b3555">[NATE moves on to another group]</div><div class="divtype3" id="par604dde80">FIRST YEAR 5 - EVAN</div><div class="divtype5" id="parc13b1fbd">Do you know if I can book the pool to take my meetings? I have 30 lined up today for my tutoring business and then another 60 tomorrow. I’ve been running a tight schedule since I was 5 and I can’t let it fall through now.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par9cafcf00">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par06fa631c">Oh wow, you run a tutoring business? You know, I-</div><div class="divtype3" id="pard6251e33">FIRST YEAR 5 - EVAN</div><div class="divtype5" id="parac5e7cd9">Yeah, I charge 50 an hour and all my clients love me! Very lucrative business to be in but you gotta edge in early!</div><div class="divtype3" id="par21a590ac">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par47933048">That’s unfortunate, I should have thought of that.</div><div class="divtype3" id="para7c2e1fc">FIRST YEAR 6 - SYNTHIA</div><div class="divtype5" id="par7b501558">[Nerd voice]</div><div class="divtype5" id="parf0e17929">Ermmm, are there any biomedical science based clubs here??? I got a full ride scholarship to Mac due to my cutting edge research in foot fungus and am looking to continue that level of prestige here… first step cure foot fungus, next… foot chlamydia?</div><div class="divtype3" id="par8d5615ab">NATE</div><div class="divtype2" id="pard35a6aeb">Foot chlamydia?? Wow I uh…didn’t even know that was a thing! Lots to learn… I guess.</div><div class="divtype3" id="parb4deec4e">S.T.D. LEADER - anna l</div><div class="divtype5" id="parda74ad4e">Did somebody say foot chlamydia? Sounds like you would be a great candidate for the Sigma Theta Delta group. Right now we're really into safe horse sex, but we're always looking for new places to explore!</div><div class="divtype3" id="paraba11bb8">FIRST YEAR 6 - SYNTHIA</div><div class="divtype5" id="par3b5fb536">&nbsp;Wow! This is the club for me. I feel it in my bones, of which there are 206.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par68157290">S.T.D LEADER - anna l</div><div class="divtype5" id="parcb26e841">&nbsp;We're having a dopamine rush to recruit new sister chromosomes next week, and you should totally join! Come on!</div><div class="divtype2" id="par5e0e0891">[FIRST YEAR 6 and STD LEADER exit]</div><div class="divtype3" id="parf2bded04">FIRST YEAR 3 - OLIVIA</div><div class="divtype5" id="par18bf1297">Hey, which residence are you in?&nbsp;</div><div class="divtype3" id="pard1cbe5ea">FIRST YEAR 4 - CARMEN</div><div class="divtype5" id="par583d6f15">I’m in Matthews. Some say it’s a prison, but I bet that makes it great for bonding and forming community! Hey, which res are you in?</div><div class="divtype3" id="par75ac64fd">FIRST YEAR 5 - EVAN</div><div class="divtype5" id="par5f261b1c">I’m in Les Prince. It’s sinking into the ground, really gets me down to earth. Which res are you in?</div><div class="divtype2" id="par4f91d3c3">[all 3 students stare at NATE]</div><div class="divtype3" id="par2c0c039c">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="pard7927b12">Uh, actually I’m living off campus, in Westdale. I… felt like it would be a better fit for me, you know. Less prison-ey.</div><div class="divtype3" id="pared017ad1">FIRST YEAR 5 - EVAN</div><div class="divtype5" id="pardcc991e6">You’re not in res? Living off campus sounds so awesome, you’ll get so much quiet time since everyone else will be hanging out and making memories! Literally just having the time of their lives. Without you. But think of all the sleep you’ll be able to get on a Friday night, you’re so lucky! [laughs]&nbsp;</div><div class="divtype3" id="par3895ed41">NATE</div><div class="divtype2" id="par341c9262">[Uncomfy, awkward laughing]</div><div class="divtype5" id="par341c9262">Oh hahahahahaha I’m sure I’ll still have a good time… anyways I gotta talk to uhhh my mom - ahah - my dog- uhuh prof.&nbsp;</div><div class="divtype3" id="par2f6cb245">FORMULA NATURAL GAS LEADER - Felicity</div><div class="divtype2" id="pare56cdd5d">[overly eager]</div><div class="divtype5" id="parf8ac925f">Heeeeyyyy kiddo! Welcome to Mac, the place where dreams become reality and the past becomes the present. I’m the leader of Formula Natural Gas. How’s your week been? Make any new friends yet??&nbsp;</div><div class="divtype5" id="par68ecb1c9">[NATE stares blankly, sad face emerges]</div><div class="divtype3" id="par70ff37f0">FORMULA NATURAL GAS LEADER (CONT’D)</div><div class="divtype5" id="par3bf68761">Ok… no friends yet… not to worry! Keep your head up king, or the crown will fall. Heh… How was your move in? Got a cool roomie???</div><div class="divtype3" id="par11a12c7d">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par78ffec0b">[awkward] I actually didn’t get into residence, I think my marks weren’t… good enough. I got too confident and now I’m stuck a million miles away from campus in Westdale.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par8b93b681">FORMULA NATURAL GAS LEADER - FELICITY</div><div class="divtype5" id="parb997305a">Really? That’s weird… I would’ve thought if you got into eng, then your grades would have been high enough to get into res.</div><div class="divtype3" id="parc68e29b2">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par55936225">It’s all my fault, I shouldn’t have applied to PG, I knew how competitive it was.&nbsp;</div><div class="divtype3" id="par880c362d">FORMULA NATURAL GAS LEADER - FELICITY</div><div class="divtype5" id="par9a199e35">No man you’re good, I actually don’t think that’s how that works… Oh well, at least you’ll be right next door to the bars.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par4d37e178">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par010a8703">But I’m underage?</div><div class="divtype3" id="par9a5bbf19">FORMULA NATURAL GAS LEADER - FELICITY</div><div class="divtype5" id="par7a484871">Ohh that’s true…. well at least the dispensary is great!</div><div class="divtype3" id="par8078bf9e">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="parfbfeb121">Um well, like I said, I’m still underage…</div><div class="divtype3" id="par62be3717">FORMULA NATURAL GAS LEADER - FELICITY</div><div class="divtype5" id="par02ab01c0">Even better than all of that is the Bean Bar-</div><div class="divtype3" id="par334b45cd">NATE&nbsp;</div><div class="divtype5" id="pard8d309c9">AAAAAAAAAAAAA- sorry. Just, you know, legumes, beans… scary stuff...</div><div class="divtype3" id="par55268c5e">FORMULA NATURAL GAS LEADER - FELICITY</div><div class="divtype5" id="par3fabb4fb">You’re a little strange, kiddo. But that’s okay! Hey, which street did you say you were on?</div><div class="divtype3" id="par42d33537">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="pard601d11f">Cline… why?</div><div class="divtype3" id="par54aab621">FORMULA NATURAL GAS LEADER - FELICITY</div><div class="divtype5" id="par2a62c78f">You don’t say! I heard that’s like the new place to be.&nbsp;</div><div class="divtype3" id="par7754111d">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par2561da50">Really? Why’s that?</div><div class="divtype3" id="pardd268f3f">FORMULA NATURAL GAS LEADER - FELICITY</div><div class="divtype5" id="par8fcdbf43">I’ll let you in on a secret… a hot new bombshell has entered the villa, and even being seen within 5 feet of her can get you places. She lives on your street so that’s, well that’s about, 5-feet away! Consider yourself lucky as fucky!&nbsp;</div><div class="divtype3" id="par1386abad">FORMULA NUCLEAR LEADER - </div><div class="divtype5" id="par72f86de1">I think I’ve heard about her… didn’t she also start a club this year??? Before she even transferred here? Some kind of crazy rocket kayak tech team…</div><div class="divtype3" id="par98ca41e1">FORMULA COAL LEADER</div><div class="divtype5" id="par2506088e">Yeah, she’s a Waterloo transfer, heard she was top of her class over there too. Can’t believe we are lucky enough to have her come here instead!</div><div class="divtype3" id="par4b652f99">FORMULA NUCLEAR&nbsp;LEADER</div><div class="divtype5" id="pard012c6fe">They say she’s done some crazy stuff. We call her GATSBY, her Linkedin doesn’t even have her first name. Like Cher, Shakira, or Madonna. Legendary.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par0bebef27">GOSSIP 1 - Nicole</div><div class="divtype5" id="parcad6d955">GATSBY?! You mean that girl who tamed llamas in JHE field? I heard she had them leaping through the iron ring while it was on fire and shit!&nbsp;</div><div class="divtype3" id="pard4c8a3ac">GOSSIP 2 - kurtis</div><div class="divtype5" id="par2adcf56e">I heard she developed an Uber service for yachts on the East Coast in her spare time last summer!</div><div class="divtype3" id="par3aa059d3">GOSSIP 3 - mattea</div><div class="divtype5" id="par0c462450">Dude! I heard she put a pool in a car. A car… pool. Who could pull that off? She’s an absolute legend, definitely going great places!</div><div class="divtype3" id="paraa4fb8c5">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="pare605c638">Woah, GATSBY, huh? Sounds like someone I should probably meet. Do you know—</div><div class="divtype3" id="parda3e5629">GOSSIP 4 - Kaylyn</div><div class="divtype5" id="parfdd7796e">Good luck pal, everyone wants to work with her. Her technical team, Space Canoe, got more applications than Formula Natural Gas, Formula Coal, Formula Nuclear, and Formula Formula combined. But, as we say to all first years, try your best… and you can cry quietly if you fail.</div><div class="divtype3" id="parafb6bb51">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par0c0f99a3">&nbsp;This could be just what I need! I don’t have a research scholarship or a tutoring business, but if I could just talk to this GATSBY, or get on her technical team, or on any technical team for that matter, then maybe I stand a chance to —</div><div class="divtype3" id="par7d329842">ROSIE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par7fe9aa6b">NATE! Nice to see you on campus! How’s your Welcome Week been? Are you settling in okay?</div><div class="divtype3" id="par4a3896f5">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="parabed7864">ROSIE! There sure is a lot going on here…I just learned about foot chlamydia so we’re off to… a start. Did you hear about this outbreak they have?</div><div class="divtype3" id="parf2be5cae">ROSIE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par2bd99cc5">Are you talking about what was going around last spring? Don’t worry too much about that, as long as you have your shower shoes you should be all good. Don't get beat, wrap your feet!</div><div class="divtype3" id="par5ef3da6f">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par44c445f3">Oh…I don’t have shower shoes. Guess I can add foot attire to the list of things I don’t have prepped.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par31314fd3">ROSIE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par12859cf8">Maybe I can take you to Walmart to grab some once Clubsfest is wrapped up. You don't need to know everything just yet, that's what older folks like me are here for!</div><div class="divtype3" id="par8b8ee322">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par5f8303d4">I’m really lucky to have you looking out for me but I can’t lie, I already feel left behind. Everyone here is really flashing their academic guns.&nbsp;</div><div class="divtype3" id="pard58f1360">ROSIE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par3a99aaf6">Aw come on, don’t worry about it. You’ll find your people, I guarantee it. And until then, you have me. Just give it time.</div><div class="divtype3" id="parf9333deb">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par797af21d">Where do I even start though?&nbsp;</div><div class="divtype3" id="parc45f85cf">ROSIE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par41d8ff0e">The technical team I co-run, HITBIKERS, is hosting a recruitment event for first-years just like you! All the execs will be there as well! You should totally drop by. We’re super spoked about it.</div><div class="divtype3" id="pare026041f">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par8b77b7f8">Execs? Technical team? That sounds super important, isn’t that like exactly what engineers are supposed to do?</div><div class="divtype3" id="parff5ff6d1">ROSIE</div><div class="divtype5" id="para60aaec3">Well it’s definitely one thing they can do, but there's lots out there.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par7bdfa7d5">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par32a6426d">Yeah but what are the other first years gonna say if I join that crazy musical, or worse, the MES! I have to get something I can put on my resume that employers will actually care about, or I’m never gonna get a co-op.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par56396a40">ROSIE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par7a165c75">Alright well either way, come out to our event and I’ll introduce you to the team and what we do. I’ll send you the post about it on LinkedIn.</div><div class="divtype3" id="parf6073cea">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par3a2442f9">Sounds great! Once I have an account, I’ll totally see you there!</div><div class="divtype0" id="par046df54b" data-scene="2">scene name here</div><div class="divtype0" id="par9f039d78" data-scene="3">Scene name here</div><div class="divtype0" id="par504bea37" data-scene="4">Scene name here</div><div class="divtype0" id="par9d1fccd6" data-scene="5">Scene name here</div><div class="divtype2" id="par7ae75cbb">[lights up on GATSBY and NATE strolling through campus]</div><div class="divtype3" id="par84bdf893">GATSBY</div><div class="divtype5" id="par744eded5">…And then, you know what I said? I believe it was something he took to heart: The rest is just math!</div><div class="divtype3" id="parfeb4fcad">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par04d548ca">I never knew Doctor Nejatsby spent so much time at Waterloo!</div><div class="divtype3" id="par84b6ee3c">GATSBY</div><div class="divtype5" id="par0574e6b4">Oh you know, he would stop by every now and again. He came over during reading week for tea and to bounce some quantum physics ideas off of me. Nothing crazy really…</div><div class="divtype2" id="par43515ead">[Gestures to Thode]</div><div class="divtype5" id="parae1fd9a8">And here we are. You know, this is where I really began my journey at McMaster, Thode. During the wee hours, burning the midnight oil at a dry rotted cubicle. It’s a special place. You’d be surprised what you can accomplish here in just a few short hours.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par36649dd7">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par1ba6da21">I still can’t believe you aced six midterms in one day with only three hours to study!</div><div class="divtype3" id="pare72524cb">GATSBY</div><div class="divtype5" id="para4acb4cb">Yes, I certainly did do that. And don’t worry kid, stick with me and soon enough you’ll be doing the same! I’ll show you the GATSBY annotation method- it’s bound to save you in a pinch.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par649a7e9f">GENERAL STUDENT 1</div><div class="divtype5" id="pare9bbe1f4">Oh my God, are you THE GATSBY??? You’re the one who saved all of JHE from that fire.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par07e56b93">GATSBY</div><div class="divtype5" id="par71dc3bc1">You flatter me, it was just a simple toaster fire in the MES office. Luckily, I was able to act fast and contain the blaze, all thanks to my sharp nose.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par39664e27">GENERAL STUDENT 2</div><div class="divtype2" id="par9ad580fe">[On the phone]</div><div class="divtype5" id="par20dad3eb">Yeah, GATSBY’s here! Right outside of Thode with some dude! No, I don’t know the absolute loser nobody she’s talking to.</div><div class="divtype3" id="pare532a5e4">GENERAL STUDENT 3</div><div class="divtype5" id="parec9d47d0">This kid must really be something if THE GATSBY wants to talk to him. She’d never associate with someone less than exceptional, especially after she saved five cats from a collapsing building, and got the key to the city.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par055144ef">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par8ecc1b13">I feel like I would’ve heard about that on the news?</div><div class="divtype3" id="par8bfc3ccb">GATSBY</div><div class="divtype5" id="parc65de04b">That’s because you’re not a global citizen like I am! It was in the deep suburbs of Brampton, Ontario.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par66492d7b">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par28325d41">I know you probably get this question a lot, but how can I do things like that? I feel like I’m about to waste my best years doing nothing but studying, and not have anything to show for it.</div><div class="divtype3" id="parec0582de">GATSBY</div><div class="divtype5" id="par4111ae0c">Well, everyone walks a different road, old sport. I could bore you with the details but how about we get you a more… balanced perspective? Right inside of this library I have interrupted the studying of some of our campus’ finest. They’re the generous hands that took me in when I came to McMaster. I’d very much like you to meet them.</div><div class="divtype2" id="par676088fb">[MILES, OLIVE and CLYNT wander up to them and try to shake / DAP up Nate's hand, they each do something different?&nbsp;One by one, NATE slightly fumbles trying to guess if they’ll bump/slap/shake his hand. Make sure that NATE is wrong everytime ]</div><div class="divtype3" id="par98f66645">MILES</div><div class="divtype5" id="para5ced14b">Hey, I've seen you before, glad we can formally meet. Name's Miles Hawk, don't wear it out.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par196af2ce">OLIVE</div><div class="divtype5" id="pard7cf81ab">OLIVE EVANS, at your service.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par1142bafd">CLYNT</div><div class="divtype5" id="par191d4928">CLYNT FINGER is the name, fingering Clynts is the game.</div><div class="divtype3" id="parfef414d1">GATSBY</div><div class="divtype5" id="par8c3adc5f">CLYNT here once sang an aria so beautiful it brought Dr. Childs to tears!</div><div class="divtype3" id="parb578b998">CLYNT</div><div class="divtype5" id="parf5deca5c">It reminded him of his childs-hood.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par1f080f6b">GATSBY</div><div class="divtype5" id="parc414275a">OLIVE is even smarter than me, she would have had a 13.1 GPA if not for rounding.&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div class="divtype3" id="par0ff016f7">OLIVE</div><div class="divtype5" id="para29331d6">Stupid significant digits.</div><div class="divtype3" id="parc9d97a83">GATSBY</div><div class="divtype5" id="pare8a35315">And MILES has compiled the school’s largest Google Drive of past tests and assignments that anyone has ever seen.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par75ad2c61">MILES</div><div class="divtype5" id="par04481cfc">And I can get you in on that for the right price.&nbsp;</div><div class="divtype3" id="parb9ed40a8">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="parc700f568">Wow!! Where did they all learn to be so incredible?</div><div class="divtype3" id="para85764eb">GATSBY</div><div class="divtype5" id="pare5407217">Well NATE, why don’t you ask them?</div><div class="divtype2" id="par3b0d4c83">(GATSBY exits as the trio and NATE have a moment for themselves)&nbsp;</div><div class="divtype3" id="par106f564d">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par6d9b19c7">Where did you all learn to be so incredible?</div><div class="divtype3" id="par41be1555">MILES</div><div class="divtype5" id="pare12fcd20">It all started when we met GATSBY. Since then, our lives have gotten infinitely better.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par195bb13a">OLIVE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par8eabf5ca">Yeah I’m on pace for my best academic semester to date!</div><div class="divtype3" id="par10a78b5d">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par76093416">That all sounds great, but do you guys ever question any of this?</div><div class="divtype3" id="par90f61532">OLIVE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par6e70d235">Any of what? GATSBY’s awesomeness?</div><div class="divtype2" id="par8c126a19">Song 5: Easy Street</div><div class="divtype2" id="par9ad61e04">words</div><div class="divtype2" id="par1750d016">words</div><div class="divtype2" id="par6b0291f5">words</div><div class="divtype2" id="parf2a788bb">words</div><div class="divtype2" id="parf0160a97">words</div><div class="divtype3" id="paraa9c2642">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par6b39efa6">Woah you guys are wild! Great friends, great accomplishments,&nbsp;</div><div class="divtype2" id="para12217e4">[point to GATSBY?]</div><div class="divtype5" id="par6db066a2">great… You’ve done so much! And you used to be at Waterloo? It’s so prestigious, why would you want to leave? Aside from the depressive atmosphere and cutthroat competition.</div><div class="divtype2" id="par822f024f">&nbsp;</div><div class="divtype3" id="parcc2d3b06">GATSBY</div><div class="divtype5" id="par1ede44e0">Well Nate, there was a time before I became the living legend I am today. Back when my resume could fit on but three pages… My journey began in the hallowed halls of my hometown high school. The place where I grew into a leader, inspiring all those around me and, in turn, being inspired by them. But the time eventually came for me to move on to new adventures. My next step wasn’t McMaster; no, instead I continued my grand journey at the world-renowned institution of Waterloo. I worked designing the most sophisticated and foolproof machinery in all of the Amazon warehouses.&nbsp;</div><div class="divtype3" id="par54fdeb00">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="parf0f504d6">Whoa! How did you get that job? The interview process must’ve been crazy!</div><div class="divtype3" id="par4bd813e5">GATSBY</div><div class="divtype5" id="par03fc4e78">It also helped that before that I interned at Google, optimizing code cleanliness and company workflow.</div><div class="divtype2" id="par38d5b65d"><br></div><div class="divtype3" id="par3103ddf7">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par24f32280">I wish I could do something as important as you stopping that cyberattack when you did that co-op at RBC.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par152a6840">GATSBY</div><div class="divtype5" id="par7f5ce9f9">And that’s just my work experience, you should’ve seen the frontiers of research I was fronting. I got so far along on mechanical string theory that William McMaster Junior Junior asked me to come research at Mac!</div><div class="divtype3" id="para58ba477">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="parc0e9dd90">That’s the reason you’re here?</div><div class="divtype3" id="par86e613c9">GATSBY</div><div class="divtype5" id="par1f6994b1">No, my dear friend. As I think back on my youthful adventures and escapades, nothing really feels the same anymore… You see, I lost part of myself at Waterloo. I knew exactly what I had to do to achieve success, but it meant my peers no longer saw eye to eye with me. My ambition set me apart from them, and the rift forming between us only widened with each new accomplishment. I found myself isolated by my greatness, and I knew that I needed to come here to reunite with the one person who I had truly connected with: ROSIE FLAX. Working with her as student council co-president was the last time I felt like I was actually myself, and I’ve been chasing that feeling ever since.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par1240d015">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par8c824549">Wait? You know ROSIE? She’s my cousin! The one I was telling you about!</div><div class="divtype3" id="par85d1083b">GATSBY</div><div class="divtype5" id="par91f7acf1">Your cousin! What! Wow! How has she been doing lately? It’s been so long since we’ve spoken.</div><div class="divtype3" id="pard22885a1">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par98c90bc4">She’s good, just super busy with HITBIKERS and studying. She’s super cool though, I really look up to her.&nbsp;</div><div class="divtype3" id="parff4add86">GATSBY</div><div class="divtype5" id="parefdd8fbe">This is such a strange coincidence! I’m your role model, she’s your role model… say, would you be able to set up a meeting between the two of us? It’d be a great opportunity to see how we could help you.&nbsp;</div><div class="divtype3" id="par37d8429a">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par65509f08">That would be so useful! And I’m sure ROSIE would love to reconnect with you. I could invite her to your next club meeting?</div><div class="divtype3" id="paraa7f41ca">GATSBY</div><div class="divtype5" id="par173ca165">Really? Would you do that? But you’d have to come as well. Just as a buffer you know?</div><div class="divtype3" id="par0d17e545">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par5c19f8ec">Well sure. Then maybe since I’m going to be there anyways, do you think you could look over my Space Canoe application?</div><div class="divtype3" id="par5463ca0f">GATSBY</div><div class="divtype5" id="parc5cb52d8">Unfortunately we aren’t taking first years at the moment. We wouldn’t want to add too much to your plate during an already busy time right?</div><div class="divtype3" id="par03dbe9f8">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="pardf375dc2">Yeah, I guess that makes sense.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par84ef4b01">GATSBY</div><div class="divtype5" id="parb8d9e3a1">Don’t worry bud, if you stick with me, good things will come your way.</div><div class="divtype0" id="par92f8dfc1" data-scene="6">Scene name here</div><div class="divtype3" id="parc3f67ff1">ROSIE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par79ed8eb6">Thanks for agreeing to come with me on such short notice, I don’t really know what I'm walking into here.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par4803f579">JAYDEN</div><div class="divtype5" id="par6cdad3dc">Of course, that’s what friends are for. Besides, the only team meetings I’ve ever been to were 'HITBIKERS ones, so I can’t say I’m not a little curious about this mysterious meeting.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par7ec965d7">ROSIE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par5fd2e752">Yeah me too. All this time GATSBY hasn’t reached out once, so why is she suddenly so keen on reconnecting?</div><div class="divtype3" id="par74e0115f">JAYDEN</div><div class="divtype5" id="par83ea9c75">You know how it is, LinkedIn demons always want to bump up those connections.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par1b91ed63">ROSIE</div><div class="divtype5" id="pard56fddb7">I don’t even know if this is the same person. I mean don’t get me wrong, the GATSBY I knew in high school was great, but we were just co-presidents. I never would have thought she would be out here doing all this.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par99933242">JAYDEN</div><div class="divtype5" id="par68396bb3">I guess this is why it’s worth going to see for yourself.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par5f41b9af">ROSIE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par6612b29a">I just don’t get it, she leaves to go to Waterloo, and now there’s all these rumours of her running Amazon, and rewriting the whole Google codebase? That can’t be the same person right? Or am I crazy?</div><div class="divtype3" id="par602ca3c4">JAYDEN</div><div class="divtype5" id="parb69ed222">No, I think it’s more than fair to be skeptical.</div><div class="divtype3" id="paref5493c3">ROSIE</div><div class="divtype5" id="pard2f4c0c5">And of course this is all happening now of all times… JAYDEN, can I be honest with you for a second?</div><div class="divtype3" id="par7d7d05c7">JAYDEN</div><div class="divtype5" id="par7e2510fd">Of course.</div><div class="divtype3" id="parcf7c1d65">ROSIE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par2fca67cf">I’m a bit worried about the direction that RICH is trying to take the HITBIKERS. I know that everyone on the team loves him, but I’m getting more and more concerned about the way he’s handling things. And everyone seems to just agree with him no matter how much I try to steer things the other way. I’ve been trying to give him the benefit of the doubt but it’s not getting any better. I think I’m going to talk to him about it.</div><div class="divtype3" id="parc5bce65f">JAYDEN</div><div class="divtype5" id="par8596b0d8">Yeahhhh, on the topic of RICH, at the last HITBIKERS social…</div><div class="divtype3" id="par0ffb50bc">ROSIE</div><div class="divtype2" id="pard6df1409">[eye roll]</div><div class="divtype5" id="par12462b26">What’d he do this time?</div><div class="divtype3" id="par8cc1cd89">JAYDEN</div><div class="divtype5" id="par2a607c7e">Well we were at the bar celebrating with the team, and then when the end of the night rolled around… actually nevermind. Forget about it, let's just head into the meeting! It’s a long story, and I definitely wouldn’t do it full justice here.</div><div class="divtype3" id="parb1175042">ROSIE</div><div class="divtype5" id="parca442b51">If you’re sure… but you can talk to me about anything JAYDEN.</div><div class="divtype2" id="pared3797e1">[Space Canoers fawning over GATSBY, fixing her hair, tie, shoes, etc]</div><div class="divtype3" id="par61c6039b">SPACE CANOER 1</div><div class="divtype5" id="par820fa88f">Here GATSBY, try this new canoe scented perfume. It’s sandalwood and swampwater.</div><div class="divtype3" id="parc8e3d78d">SPACE CANOER 2</div><div class="divtype5" id="par0c5f7ffb">I think this tie would go nicely with your eyes, it’s very lavish and elegant in a classy way, you’re gonna look so professional!</div><div class="divtype3" id="par11e0b796">SPACE CANOER 3</div><div class="divtype5" id="pare057b26f">Maybe try parting your hair this way instead. A centre part screams success in a way that a side part could never.</div><div class="divtype3" id="pare5571ca2">GATSBY</div><div class="divtype2" id="par98c18168">[talking closely with a few space canoers while the other fuck around, he becomes audible as Rosie and Jayden get closer]</div><div class="divtype5" id="par5ef3e5f4">Thanks paddlers, I gotta make sure I put my best foot forward for our potential co-lead. Trust me, the moment she gets here you’ll understand. She is the pinnacle of leadership. She radiates– Ow! Berin! Easy with the hair. Do you think these bangs just come naturally?</div><div class="divtype3" id="par70a515d4">SPACE CANOER 4</div><div class="divtype5" id="parab973b6b">Is that her, GATSBY? Is that ROSIE?</div><div class="divtype2" id="parc1c093f7">[GATSBY scurries people into position]</div><div class="divtype3" id="pard5ea6afd">GATSBY</div><div class="divtype5" id="par27cc8562">So as I was saying, every single member of the faculty voted, and said that I was their favourite student.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par89b4a4d3">ROSIE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par365463fe">Hey, Lee- uh, GATSBY?&nbsp;</div><div class="divtype3" id="pareecd08d6">GATSBY</div><div class="divtype5" id="para77b4e5c">Oh ROSIE, I didn’t see you there.&nbsp;</div><div class="divtype3" id="pare5ae423e">ROSIE</div><div class="divtype5" id="parccb62cbf">Yeah I just got here, are we late to the meeting?</div><div class="divtype3" id="par944ab168">GATSBY</div><div class="divtype5" id="par4cc7284f">No, not at all, we were just about to get started.&nbsp;</div><div class="divtype2" id="par8344026b">[shoos away the Space Canoers he was talking to]</div><div class="divtype3" id="parea2e5d36">Well, I mean, we’re not starting right away. We have a second - a couple of seconds. To say hi. Hi!</div><div class="divtype3" id="par90cdf339">ROSIE</div><div class="divtype5" id="parbf206004">Hi.</div><div class="divtype2" id="parc890cf6e">[NATE butts his head in]</div><div class="divtype3" id="pard8e9e7da">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par6a38963e">Hi!</div><div class="divtype3" id="pardf498862">JAYDEN</div><div class="divtype5" id="pard53508f3">I’m gonna give you guys a second to catch up.</div><div class="divtype3" id="parcf0bd139">GATSBY</div><div class="divtype2" id="par98aafe7d">[Ignoring NATE and JAYDEN]</div><div class="divtype5" id="par2e38c2f2">So! How have you been holding up? NATE’s been telling me about all the amazing things you’ve been doing for HITBIKERS!</div><div class="divtype3" id="par8e2cc281">ROSIE</div><div class="divtype2" id="par7dd4feb0">[Unsure, almost questioning her but not really]&nbsp;</div><div class="divtype5" id="par84acaba5">Um- yeah! Haha, I’m good. It’s good to see you again. It’s just… well, I’ve heard so much about you too… it’s almost like you're a whole new person. With all of these co-ops and your research, you’ve clearly been very busy.</div><div class="divtype3" id="para3797c55">GATSBY&nbsp;</div><div class="divtype5" id="para786b503">What can I say, seeing all the hard work you were doing inspired me to do the same. So I pulled myself up by my bootstraps and started climbing the corporate ladder. Between Google, RBC, and delivering at Amazon, my hands have been quite full.&nbsp;</div><div class="divtype3" id="par56494577">NATE&nbsp;</div><div class="divtype5" id="par87b69147">Wait, delivering?</div><div class="divtype3" id="par9ec411b7">GATSBY&nbsp;</div><div class="divtype2" id="par8f215355">[to NATE]&nbsp;</div><div class="divtype5" id="par225bda34">*chuckles* … Of course, delivering 100% profits to the company. But what I’m proudest of is this team.</div><div class="divtype2" id="par67631d8c">[to ROSIE]</div><div class="divtype5" id="par6493afd2">You’ve always been so kind and compassionate, and such a strong leader, that I wanted to take a page out of your book. After I was done saving those dogs I was searching for something to give me more fulfillment. Starting Space Canoe was the obvious next step.</div><div class="divtype3" id="pare45b77e9">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par2a800cb3">Hold on, I thought you said you saved cats?</div><div class="divtype3" id="par21c671c7">GATSBY</div><div class="divtype5" id="par91d39a5b">The landlord was very pet-friendly. There were all sorts of animals in the building – cats, dogs, even a domesticated raccoon.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par2e4ccd66">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="pare05bf4d6">Makes sense.&nbsp;</div><div class="divtype2" id="parc2f1964f">[shrugs it off because he loves GATSBY]&nbsp;</div><div class="divtype3" id="parece669bd">GATSBY</div><div class="divtype5" id="pard4fb3978">Anyways, ROSIE, I asked you here to extend an invitation for you to co-lead Space Canoe with me.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par508a0a00">ROSIE</div><div class="divtype5" id="pare3736b04">Co-lead Space Canoe? Woah I don’t know if –</div><div class="divtype3" id="par2e93cae0">GATSBY</div><div class="divtype5" id="pard4420973">Think about it, the dream team back together, conquering any obstacle the world throws at us! What do you say?&nbsp;</div><div class="divtype3" id="parc2b2d9a1">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="paracf970d7">Wow ROSIE, I can’t believe you get to lead with THE GATSBY!</div><div class="divtype3" id="par6f6b0954">ROSIE</div><div class="divtype5" id="pare7273ad6">Sorry, I think I just… need a second to think about all this.</div><div class="divtype2" id="parf9b9a72f">[to JAYDEN]</div><div class="divtype5" id="par08ea4cfc">It’s been so long, she’s changed so much. Would we still get along as well as we did in high school? And… wow. Do you think, I mean… joining Space Canoe. How would that even work, with RICH and HITBIKERS and everything?</div><div class="divtype3" id="par7a956051">JAYDEN</div><div class="divtype5" id="par6984505c">It’s a lot to process. And are you even allowed to lead two clubs at once?</div><div class="divtype3" id="parcbfff2ab">ROSIE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par5bd57764">Not only that, but would I even have the time? My Google Calendar is already booked solid as-is, and that’s including the one hour a week I’ve blocked off for friendship catchups. I can’t… I just can’t, right?</div><div class="divtype3" id="para37d2554">JAYDEN</div><div class="divtype5" id="par38237888">I mean, GATSBY really does seem earnest about wanting your help.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par308e8a0f">ROSIE</div><div class="divtype5" id="parda3c73f9">And of course I want to help my old friend, especially if it’s to get a new team off the ground, and I’ve seen how much a club can do for people. And I already have so many ideas, plus NATE just seems so excited…</div><div class="divtype5" id="parf4570675">I think I have to do it.&nbsp;</div><div class="divtype2" id="par99f17d43">[To GATSBY]</div><div class="divtype5" id="para8e2e4cc">Okay… I’m in.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par2ece81a5">GATSBY</div><div class="divtype2" id="par1f3b0552">[best day of her life]</div><div class="divtype5" id="par3ae4d1c2">Really? YES! I CAN’T BELIEVE IT! I mean yeah this is going to be super cool.</div><div class="divtype3" id="para4872768">ROSIE</div><div class="divtype5" id="parfc73890b">Buuuut I do have a few conditions. Number one, I want you to seriously consider first year applicants. They bring fresh eyes to the team and are important for passing on knowledge. If I’m going to help lead this team we can’t be excluding first years like Nate.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par0f7a186c">GATSBY</div><div class="divtype5" id="par5a44893e">What a coincidence! I read through his application this morning and was just about to send him the acceptance email!&nbsp;</div><div class="divtype3" id="par8ef7b5d1">NATE</div><div class="divtype5" id="parba8c758a">Oh my gosh, that’s such a relief. I thought I was going to be tech teamless my whole life!</div><div class="divtype3" id="parf47e1cf8">ROSIE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par0ffcaaba">Number two, I need to know that this will be an equal partnership, where we listen to each other and we work together.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par19d83986">GATSBY</div><div class="divtype5" id="parf2bd2b12">Yes, 100%! ROSIE, thank you so much, Space Canoe will fly higher than ever with you by my side–</div><div class="divtype3" id="parb6781898">ROSIE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par384b4b13">Aaaand number three, nobody outside these walls can know I’m helping you. I don’t want HITBIKERS thinking I’m not giving them my all anymore.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par48178ba2">GATSBY</div><div class="divtype5" id="parcc29d71a">Yes, yes, of course, consider it done!</div><div class="divtype3" id="par1b7a1422">ROSIE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par62267bae">You promise?</div><div class="divtype3" id="par07300d84">GATSBY</div><div class="divtype5" id="par8b129210">I promise.</div><div class="divtype3" id="pare4e7c847">ROSIE</div><div class="divtype5" id="par2ad937ed">Alright, then. It’s settled. It’ll be nice for us to lead a team again.</div><div class="divtype3" id="par640a8c0d">GATSBY</div><div class="divtype5" id="par457ae99a">Things are about to get so much better now that you’re here.</div><div class="divtype2" id="par4a934e77">(To the rest of Space Canoe)</div><div class="divtype5" id="parba55e74b">Say hello to our new co-lead!</div><div class="divtype3" id="par8cece12f">SPACE CANOER 1</div><div class="divtype5" id="par3c81008c">If I had a nickel for every co-lead I had, I would have…</div><div class="divtype2" id="par3ff393d1">[struggles to count on fingers]</div><div class="divtype3" id="par1a512e94">SPACE CANOER 2</div><div class="divtype5" id="par87d7a5ef">…2 nickels!!</div><div class="divtype3" id="par4047391f">SPACE CANOER 3</div><div class="divtype5" id="par5ead4e38">This is fantastic! Surely this will only lead to good things!</div><div class="divtype2" id="par6890d9d0">Song 6: Walking On Sunshine</div><div class="divtype2" id="pare6c7d106">words</div><div class="divtype2" id="parf3407e9a">words</div><div class="divtype2" id="parf2fe7cad">words</div><div class="divtype2" id="para30dc9c0">words</div><div class="divtype2" id="parcc2ea9ae">words</div><div class="divtype2" id="par6d6bcdd4">words</div><div class="divtype0" id="para2533a8e" data-scene="7">Scene name here</div><div class="divtype0" id="par61c2d79f" data-scene="8">scene name here</div><div class="divtype0" id="par20f916e2" data-scene="9">Scene name here</div><div class="divtype0" id="parc1afd7cf" data-scene="10">Scene name here</div><div class="divtype0" id="par32e4621c" data-scene="11">Scene name here</div><div class="divtype0" id="par51421772" data-scene="12">Scene name here</div><div class="divtype0" id="par52c35a05" data-scene="13">Scene name here</div>